      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "React: keeps tokens in memory; refreshes before requests.\nKeycloak: stores users/passwords, signs tokens and owns the SSO session.\nAPI: verifies tokens using public keys; never receives the password.\nLogout ends SSO; an existing access token can last until its five-minute expiry.",
      "originalText": "React: keeps tokens in memory; refreshes before requests.\nKeycloak: stores users/passwords, signs tokens and owns the SSO session.\nAPI: verifies tokens using public keys; never receives the password.\nLogout ends SSO; an existing access token can last until its five-minute expiry.",
